    "sentence_translations": [
      "(12) Where Have You Been?",
      "",
      "Little Dong was crying.",
      "",
      "Little Dong’s dad listened to Little Dong’s story and felt that he wasn’t a good dad.",
      "He worked at the hospital. His work was very busy, and he was seldom able to return home.",
      "He was a doctor, but he was also a dad. His son was often alone at home and didn’t have anyone to talk with.",
      "",
      "Now, Old Guan had disappeared. What should Dad do? Should he dial 110? Where had Old Guan gone?",
      "She hadn’t answered the phone for five days. Had she not returned home these five days? What had happened to her?",
      "Little Dong looked at Dad. Dad looked at Little Dong.",
      "It was now 10:30 pm. Dad was calling. Would Old Guan return home at this time?",
      "",
      "“Hello? Is it Little Dong?” Old Guan answered the phone.",
      "",
      "“Old Guan! Old Guan …” Little Dong was crying.",
      "",
      "“Little Dong, don’t cry, don’t cry. What’s wrong?” Old Guan said.",
      "",
      "“Where have you been?” Little Dong asked."
    ]
  }
